WEBVTT

00:08:59.827 --> 00:09:01.370
Then this guy showed up.

00:09:01.370 --> 00:09:02.830
His name is Kevin.

00:09:03.247 --> 00:09:06.250
You know, when I saw him,
I was like, "Whoa."

00:09:06.292 --> 00:09:11.547
In my life, I'll never have a second
chance to ask a guy, hopefully,

00:09:11.547 --> 00:09:13.799
why he has a fucking swastika on his face.

00:09:13.841 --> 00:09:15.843
(Laughter)

00:09:15.884 --> 00:09:19.138
And so I ask him,
and he was like, "Oh, this?"

00:09:19.179 --> 00:09:20.681
Almost like he forgot about it.

00:09:20.681 --> 00:09:23.767
He was like, "I did this as a gang thing
when I went in prison.

00:09:23.767 --> 00:09:25.728
But now, if I could, I would remove it."

00:09:25.769 --> 00:09:28.731
I was like, "OK, do you mind
if I take a photo and I share it?"

00:09:28.772 --> 00:09:29.940
He's like, "Yeah, sure."

00:09:29.982 --> 00:09:31.150
I share that photo.